# UX workflow: cancel a destination-first ADSR audition.
# Purpose: proves Back removes the provisional source, typed trigger, and
# destination together and restores the same empty Macro modulation surface.
# Expect: capture_changed:adsr_audition_default=adsr_audition_changed, capture_changed:adsr_audition_changed=modulation_restored
# Expect: semantic:adsr_audition_default:effect=start_adsr_audition, semantic:adsr_audition_default:source=adsr, semantic:adsr_audition_default:projection=audible_audition
# Expect: semantic:adsr_audition_changed:effect=edit_adsr_attack, semantic:modulation_restored:effect=cancel_adsr_audition

0 scenario macro
80 capture screen macro_ready

180 button MACRO_1 down
1240 tick
1300 button MACRO_1 up
1450 encoder NAV 1
1570 encoder NAV 1
1690 tap NAV 60
1810 encoder NAV 1
1930 tap NAV 60
2150 capture screen adsr_audition_default

2270 encoder OPT 0.80
2490 capture screen adsr_audition_changed

# LEFT_TOP is local Cancel; no source, trigger, edge, or Undo residue remains.
2610 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2830 capture screen modulation_restored
